# Kebu Economic Discovery

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-ECONOMIC-DISCOVERY.md` · Search: `docs/product/KEBU-SEARCH.md`

## Thesis (20-year)

Kebu/RECT = **economic discovery system** — not an ad network. Not “African Google.”

**Google unit:** webpage. **Kebu unit (target):** opportunity · entity · transaction · relationship.

Flywheel: **SEARCH → DISCOVER → UNDERSTAND → BUILD → SELL → GET CUSTOMERS → SCALE**

## Search = hub (core Kebu product)

Modes: Web · Africa · Business · Products · People/Talent · Research · Trade · Opportunities · Culture (RECT) · Local.

**Ask Kebu:** AI synthesis **with citations** — on top of retrieval, never instead.

Example query surfaces: Products · Businesses · Trade · Opportunity (sourced) · People · Culture · Intelligence · Build · Finance — **one index slice at a time**.

## Revenue systems (not ads alone)

| System | Notes |
|--------|--------|
| **Reach** | Ads/placement — tiny budgets OK — NOT STARTED until slice |
| **Marketplace** | Transaction fees on Shop/commerce |
| **Leads** | Quote requests to verified businesses |
| **Business Profiles** | Discoverable Kebu ID infrastructure |
| **B2B / Trade** | Suppliers, Opportunity OS + Search — high priority long-term |
| **RECT** | Creator economy; Culture index in Search |
| **Cloud · Builder · Mail/Domains** | Usage + subscriptions — build first, monetize success |
| **Intelligence** | Paid depth — sourced, trust-labeled |
| **Capital** | Future, regulated, separate — never fake |

## Rules

- Monetize **attention + transactions + leads + intelligence** — subscriptions are one stream.  
- Small African businesses: **low experiment cost** for Reach/Leads.  
- **No invented market stats** · trust labels mandatory · end-to-end slices only.  
- RECT = cultural source; Kebu = infrastructure — **Kebu is not the media company.** See `docs/product/KEBU-RECT-ECOSYSTEM.md`.  
- **Forbidden:** banner-only Reach · fake supplier listings · chat-as-search · revenue UI without backend.
